/* 视觉规范对齐网页版（yunsaomu.vercel.app）：雾青底、纸色卡片、松绿主色、宋体标题 */
page {
  --ink: #2a2a26;
  --ink-soft: #4a4a44;
  --paper: #e8e4d8;
  --paper-2: #f3efe4;
  --moss: #5c6b56;
  --pine: #3d4f40;
  --pine-2: #2f3e32;
  --mist: #c5cbbf;
  --stone: #8a877c;
  --stone-light: #b8b4a8;
  --accent: #6b5344;
  --bg: #d5d8cc;
  --danger: #7a3a32;
  --ok: #3d5a42;
  --gold: #e6c86e;
  --line: #c5bfb0;
  --field: #faf7f0;
  --shadow: 0 16rpx 56rpx rgba(40, 40, 32, 0.16);
  --serif: "Noto Serif CJK SC", "Noto Serif SC", "Songti SC", "STSong", serif;
  --sans: "PingFang SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
button { font-family: inherit; }
button::after { border: none; }

/* 页面底：顶部一束柔光 + 雾青渐变 */
.page-bg {
  min-height: 100vh; box-sizing: border-box;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, #e4e7dc 0%, rgba(228, 231, 220, 0) 55%), linear-gradient(180deg, #cfd4c6, #d8dccf 40%, #c5cbb8);
}

.serif { font-family: var(--serif); }

.btn {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 96rpx; padding: 0 40rpx; margin: 0; border-radius: 28rpx;
  background: var(--pine); color: var(--paper-2); font-size: 32rpx; letter-spacing: 1rpx;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow); line-height: 1.4;
}
.btn.hover { background: var(--pine-2); transform: scale(0.98); }
.btn.ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--pine); box-shadow: none; border: 2rpx solid #8a9584; }
.btn.small { min-height: 88rpx; font-size: 28rpx; padding: 0 28rpx; }
.btn[disabled] { opacity: 0.55; background: var(--pine) !important; color: var(--paper-2) !important; }

.card {
  background: rgba(243, 239, 228, 0.92); border: 2rpx solid rgba(90, 86, 74, 0.12);
  border-radius: 36rpx; padding: 44rpx 40rpx 48rpx; box-shadow: var(--shadow); box-sizing: border-box;
}
.card .h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 44rpx; margin: 0 0 16rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.card .sub { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 26rpx; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 36rpx; }

.muted { color: var(--stone); font-size: 24rpx; }
.field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 28rpx; }
.field .label { font-size: 26rpx; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 12rpx; }
.field .hint { font-size: 24rpx; color: var(--stone); margin-top: 8rpx; }
.input {
  min-height: 88rpx; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 24rpx; border-radius: 20rpx;
  background: var(--field); border: 2rpx solid var(--line); color: var(--ink); font-size: 32rpx;
}
.textarea {
  width: auto; min-height: 176rpx; padding: 20rpx 24rpx; border-radius: 20rpx;
  background: var(--field); border: 2rpx solid var(--line); color: var(--ink); font-size: 32rpx;
}
.err { color: var(--danger); font-size: 26rpx; margin: 8rpx 0 20rpx; }

/* 分段选择（网页版 .seg-btn） */
.seg { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12rpx; }
.seg-btn {
  min-height: 80rpx; padding: 0 24rpx; border-radius: 20rpx; border: 2rpx solid #b9b4a4;
  background: var(--field); color: var(--ink); font-size: 28rpx; display: flex; align-items: center;
}
.seg-btn.on { background: var(--pine); color: var(--paper-2); border-color: var(--pine); }
